                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "You should be able to get the vaccines you need, regardless of RFK Jr.\u2019s conspiracy theories.\n \nThis week, Democrats called out top insurance companies, asking them to follow the science and cover vaccines at no cost for every American \u2014 regardless of who\u2019s in office. I was proud to join @RepCasten, @RepKimSchrier, and over 80 Democrats in this effort.",
