                "text": "In less than 10 hours, the U.S. government will shut down, and Mike Johnson\u2019s to do list will almost be complete. \n\nRather than negotiate with Democrats on a bipartisan bill, Republicans would rather take healthcare away from 5 million Americans. https://t.co/p4Q677cuds",
