                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\u201cWill my Medicare or Medicaid be interrupted?\u201d\nYou should still receive your Medicare and/or Medicaid benefits. Medicare and Medicaid will continue for the foreseeable future, but you may experience difficulty reaching these agencies, as some employees are furloughed. The Medicare open enrollment period running from October 15, 2025, through December 7, 2025, will be unaffected, although communications from the agency may be stalled or outdated, and you should anticipate processing delays.",
