                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The party that is trying to take your healthcare away is painting themselves as... the grim reaper.\u00a0\n\nWhile Trump is celebrating the #RepublicanShutdown, I am in my district caring for constituents and holding firm to not let this White House leave millions hungry and uninsured.",
