                "text": "I recently visited Howard Brown Health center. With locations in Northalsted and Englewood, Howard Brown provides critical care to our community, particularly for those with HIV.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nBut due to the Republican #Medicaid cuts, Howard Brown may have to shift their services. Learn more here.",
