                "text": "Open enrollment is only a couple weeks away, and millions of Americans' insurance premiums are about to skyrocket.\n\nI'm joining nearly 150 other @HouseDemocrats in demanding Mike Johnson come to the table, end the #RepublicanShutdown, and save our health care. https://t.co/duF3SYEdXd",
